  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation RUP Phase II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering RUP Fas II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida har st&#xf6;tt l&#xe4;nsstyrelsens i J&#xf6;nk&#xf6;pings l&#xe4;n samarbete med motparter i Litauen i tv&#xe5; faser. Efter fas ett gjorde Eurofutures en uppf&#xf6;ljning d&#xe4;r man rekommenderade en forts&#xe4;ttning. Detta beslut avser en utv&#xe4;rdering av forts&#xe4;ttningen, Regional Development Plans in Lithuania, Fas II dnr 2000-2417, beslut 672/02.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida has supported development cooperation between J&#xf6;nk&#xf6;ping County board and Lithuanian counterparts in two phases. After phase one Eurofutures made an evaluation and supported a continuation of the project. This decison concerns the evaluation of phase II, Regional Development plans in Lithuania Phase II, decision 672/02.</narrative>
  </description>
